  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 pounds lean ground beef",
    "0.5 teaspoon seasoned meat tenderizer",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "2 teaspoons butter",
    "2 (4 ounce) cans sliced mushrooms, drained",
    "2 tablespoons soy sauce",
    "4 slices Swiss cheese",
    "6 hamburger buns"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat and lightly oil the grate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VluC7KheThGNmalCZ3DNyrvcS-Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/36058-grilled-mushroom-swiss-burgers-VAT-step-01-bb7f7bcd408a42f98b9fb413fff5c732.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/36058/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide ground beef into 6 equal-sized patties; season with meat tenderizer, salt, and pepper. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PonIj244XXPK2SkOirsCjJoh1Dk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/36058-grilled-mushroom-swiss-burgers-VAT-step-02-ea54e26ebde04c48839bf74a25f87cc5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/36058/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a skillet over medium heat. Add mushrooms and soy sauce; cook and stir until browned. Set aside and keep warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wCNQZ9ThwUvtWesGf8MkJuo0A6M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/36058-grilled-mushroom-swiss-burgers-VAT-step-03-c78f8c5309f548eb9ff027736305a252.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/36058/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grill patties on the preheated grill for about 2-4 minutes per side. Increase or decrease the cook time according to your desired doneness. For a well done burger, an instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read 160 degrees F (70 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0eHmlygOA0hCI09e8jx_NVMFs2o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/36058-grilled-mushroom-swiss-burgers-VAT-step-04-d1e2e463404945e691344c43ef96b7bb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/36058/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon mushroom mixture evenly on top of patties on the grill; top each one with a slice of Swiss cheese. Cover the grill until cheese melts, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/stpMFYKr05K8tP0u6bo09M7VZ3o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/36058-grilled-mushroom-swiss-burgers-VAT-step-05-c0632a3a3f124a978c015463ea97674f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/36058/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove patties from the grill and serve on hamburger buns.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sCB84u-rmid0SF_G4dnwg35r0uw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/36058-grilled-mushroom-swiss-burgers-VAT-step-06-354d9b7469c541a8bd99e8006672e656.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/36058/step_06.webp"
    }
